WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.868
-Guys, a lot of people
are talking about

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:05.538
President Biden's $1.7 trillion
infrastructure plan.

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:07.106
[ Panting ] I'm out of breath.
-Yeah.

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:09.575
[ Laughter ]

00:00:09.575 --> 00:00:12.145
-That's why I can't do
an action movie.

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:13.880
I can't do an action movie.
I do one scene,

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.315
and, "We got to get you
out of here."

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:19.085
Then I'm huffing and puffing
in the corner.

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.955
That's what happens when you see
the Jack Fallon movie --

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.289
Jake Fallon.
-Jake Fallon.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:25.458
-The Jake Fallon movie.
-The whole series the fantastic.

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:27.727
-Well, we had to put it
in three parts,

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.462
'cause I couldn't breathe
through the whole thing.

00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:30.829
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.829 --> 00:00:33.166
-COPD.
-He said two sentences.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.635
Yeah. Well, there's
a lot to know about it.

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:37.470
There's also a lot
of misinformation

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.372
about the infrastructure plan.
-Really?

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.441
-Yeah, which means it's time
for "Fact vs Fiction."

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:42.876
Here we go.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.276
-♪ Fact ♪

00:00:44.276 --> 00:00:47.947
♪ Fact or fiction ♪

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:49.649
-So, let's get started.

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:50.850
First up, fact --

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.053
The plan will cost
$1.7 trillion.

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:56.555
Fiction -- But if Biden
spends $1.8 trillion,

00:00:56.555 --> 00:00:58.558
he gets free shipping.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.493
That's fiction.
That's not true. No.

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:01.561
-That is not true.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:03.363
-Next up, fact --

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:07.133
Biden aims to fix many of the
country's old roads and bridges.

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.035
Fiction --
He plans to do most of it

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.970
with his bulk order
of Flex Seal.

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.237
-Wow.

00:01:12.237 --> 00:01:13.273
[ Imitates spraying ]

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.640
-Here's another one. Fact --

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:17.911
Biden's plan includes funding
for broadband Internet.

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.312
Fiction -- Republicans' plan

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:21.780
includes a barrel
of free AOL CDs.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:23.283
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:25.451
-Five hours?

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:26.719
-Next up, we have fact --

00:01:26.719 --> 00:01:29.956
The bill is called
the "Build Back Better Plan."

00:01:29.956 --> 00:01:32.091
Fiction -- If you can say
"Build Back Better Plan"

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:35.328
five times fast,
you get to drive the crane.

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:38.898
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:41.301
-"We're building America!"

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:43.802
"Jake Fallon
behind the wheel of a crane."

00:01:43.802 --> 00:01:45.672
-Yeah. Maybe that's how
my character gets around.

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:47.173
-Yeah, crane -- All sorts --

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.974
Man, he knows how to drive
everything, fly everything.

00:01:48.974 --> 00:01:52.077
-I like that that's his vehicle,
is a crane.

00:01:52.077 --> 00:01:56.749
Like, "There's no way
Jake Fallon knows we're here.

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:58.917
What's that crane doing here?"
-[ Imitates machine whirring ]

00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:00.353
-"It's raining.

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:02.688
What's that neon sign say?"
-Oh, my God. It's rain water!

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:04.991
-"We got to get you
out of here!"

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:07.026
♪♪

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:08.928
-"Jake Fallon."

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:10.496
-Is that the name of it?
-What's that?

00:02:10.496 --> 00:02:12.031
-What's the name of it?

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:14.500
-The first movie?
-"Somewhere to Run."

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:15.935
-"Somewhere to Run"
is the first movie.

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:18.003
"Blood Moon"
was the second movie.

00:02:18.003 --> 00:02:19.205
-"Insane in the Membrane."

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:20.640
-Insane in the main crane?

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.174
-"Insane in the Main Crane."

00:02:22.174 --> 00:02:23.576
-Insane in the crane.

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:26.345
-Yeah. Here's another fact here.

00:02:26.345 --> 00:02:30.983
Biden wants to fund the plan by
raising taxes on corporations.

00:02:30.983 --> 00:02:32.718
Fiction --
Additional money would be raised

00:02:32.718 --> 00:02:36.089
by turning the Pentagon into the
world's largest Johnny Rockets.

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:38.791
That's not true.

00:02:38.791 --> 00:02:41.627
Next up, we have fact --
$1.7 trillion can be spent

00:02:41.627 --> 00:02:45.331
on fixing roads, building
schools, and rebuilding America.

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:48.133
Fiction -- Or one new
printer ink cartridge.

00:02:48.133 --> 00:02:49.602
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:51.070
-Not so far, not so far.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:54.007
-Here's another fact -- The plan
will upgrade federal buildings.

00:02:54.007 --> 00:02:55.474
Fiction -- The plan will include

00:02:55.474 --> 00:02:57.776
adding a swim-up bar
in the White House.

00:02:57.776 --> 00:02:59.045
They're fun!
-Come on, they're fun.

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:00.880
-They're fun.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.715
Finally, fact --
Biden lowered the price

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:05.351
of his infrastructure plan
to $1.7 trillion.

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:06.719
Fiction -- If you act now,

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:08.487
he'll throw in
a complimentary tote bag.

00:03:08.487 --> 00:03:10.522
That's all the time we have
for "Fact vs Fiction."

00:03:10.522 --> 00:03:12.658
We'll be right back with
"Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:03:12.658 --> 00:03:14.727
Come on back, everybody.

00:03:14.727 --> 00:03:18.097
-In a world
where nothing was fact,

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:20.065
nothing was fiction,

00:03:20.065 --> 00:03:23.570
one man dared
to give you somewhere...

